unlock directly from windows
Pre-requiusites -
-- 1. install ipad drivers (bonjour, and ipad drivers)
-- 2. iTunes, (to confirm ipad works)
-- 3. 3utools to also confirm ipad works and connects properly
-- 4. git clone this repo, then go into the ipad2-unlock directly
-- 5. ensure that once the ipad2 is connected the machine, the 'trust'option is entered on the ipad2 device.
run unlock2.bat, which will invoke the right command to unlock the ipad2 device.
